    "detailed_description": "White Bridge is a blend of role playing game and classic JRPG.<br />\r\nIt offers an immersive world for the players to explore and interact with.<br />\r\nChoose the way you will deal with people and change the outcome<br />\r\nof how they treat you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBob is gifted a farm just outside of the town known as White Bridge<br />\r\nand immediately begins as an undercover agent for Richter Stormfront of the adventure Guild.<br />\r\nRichter tasks him to investigate the local church which he suspects is up to no good.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers will develop their character's powers, interact with other creatures and embark<br />\r\n on story-driven quests as they battle NPC's and monsters with an incredible array of <br />\r\npowers and weaponry.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*No random encounters<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Nearly ALL conflict is avoidable<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Choices matter forming different outcomes for your play through<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Customize your characters attributes<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Veteran Experience for alternate leveling<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Robust Main Story with abundance of Side Quests<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Interactive World<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Trade skills- Mining, fishing, crafting, alchemy.",
